OL,3,GNEWSAPlans for hotel and apartments on
OL,4,APeel Quayside
OL,5,
OL,6,FA planning application has been
OL,7,Fsubmitted to turn a derelict former
OL,8,Fgarage and showroom on Peel's East Quay
OL,9,Finto a boutique hotel and apartments.
OL,11,FDeveloper Lanz Limited has revealed
OL,12,Ftheir plans for the site, including a
OL,13,Fnew 21-bed hotel, nine apartments, a
OL,14,Frestaurant, cafe/bar and gym.
OL,16,FThe site is listed on the Isle of Man
OL,17,FGovernment's Unoccupied Urban Sites
OL,18,FRegister, which identifies locations
OL,19,Fprioritised for redevelopment.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB IOM NewsC Reg TVF Clean Feed
